{"text":"purananuru","n":349,"lines":["நுதிவேல் கொண்டு நுதல்வியர் தொடையாக்","கடிய கூறும் வேந்தே தந்தையும்","நெடிய அல்லது பணிந்துமொழி யலனே","இஃதுஇவர் படிவம் ஆயின் வைஎயிற்று","அரிமதர் மழைக்கண் அம்மா அரிவை","மரம்படு சிறுதீப் போல","அணங்கா யினள் தான் பிறந்த ஊர்க்கே"],"tr":["nutivēl koṇṭu nutalviyar toṭaiyāk","kaṭiya kūṟum vēntē tantaiyum","neṭiya allatu paṇintumoḻi yalaṉē","iḵtuivar paṭivam āyiṉ vaieyiṟṟu","arimatar maḻaikkaṇ ammā arivai","marampaṭu ciṟutīp pōla","aṇaṅkā yiṉaḷ tāṉ piṟanta ūrkkē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kāñci","tinai_ta":"காஞ்சி","turai_ta":"மகட்பாற் காஞ்சி","poet_ta":"மதுரை மருதனிள நாகனார்","poet_tr":"Maturai Marutaṉiḷa Nākaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 26, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 17, veṇṭaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"நுதிவேல்","tr":"nutivēl","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுதி","tr":"nuti"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேல்","tr":"vēl"}]},{"text":"கொண்டு","tr":"koṇṭu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொண்","tr":"koṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]},{"text":"நுதல்வியர்","tr":"nutalviyar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுதல்","tr":"nutal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வியர்","tr":"viyar"}]},{"text":"தொடையாக்","tr":"toṭaiyāk","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொடை","tr":"toṭai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யாக்","tr":"yāk"}]}],[{"text":"கடிய","tr":"kaṭiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடி","tr":"kaṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"கூறும்","tr":"kūṟum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றும்","tr":"ṟum"}]},{"text":"வேந்தே","tr":"vēntē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேந்","tr":"vēn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]},{"text":"தந்தையும்","tr":"tantaiyum","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தந்","tr":"tan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]}],[{"text":"நெடிய","tr":"neṭiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடி","tr":"neṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"வல்லது","tr":"vallatu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வல்","tr":"val"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லது","tr":"latu"}]},{"text":"பணிந்துமொ","tr":"paṇintumo","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பணிந்","tr":"paṇin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துமொ","tr":"tumo"}]},{"text":"ழியலனே","tr":"ḻiyalaṉē","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழிய","tr":"ḻiya"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லனே","tr":"laṉē"}]}],[{"text":"யிஃதிவர்","tr":"yiḵtivar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யிஃ","tr":"yiḵ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திவர்","tr":"tivar"}]},{"text":"படிவ","tr":"paṭiva","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படி","tr":"paṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]},{"text":"மாயின்","tr":"māyiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யின்","tr":"yiṉ"}]},{"text":"வையெயிற்","tr":"vaiyeyiṟ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யெயிற்","tr":"yeyiṟ"}]}],[{"text":"றரிமதர்","tr":"ṟarimatar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றரி","tr":"ṟari"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மதர்","tr":"matar"}]},{"text":"மழைக்க","tr":"maḻaikka","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மழைக்","tr":"maḻaik"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]},{"text":"ணம்மா","tr":"ṇammā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணம்","tr":"ṇam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"}]},{"text":"வரிவை","tr":"varivai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரி","tr":"vari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"}]}],[{"text":"மரம்படு","tr":"marampaṭu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரம்","tr":"maram"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"படு","tr":"paṭu"}]},{"text":"சிறுதீப்","tr":"ciṟutīp","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தீப்","tr":"tīp"}]},{"text":"போல","tr":"pōla","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ல","tr":"la"}]}],[{"text":"வணங்கா","tr":"vaṇaṅkā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வணங்","tr":"vaṇaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"}]},{"text":"யினள்தான்","tr":"yiṉaḷtāṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினள்","tr":"yiṉaḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தான்","tr":"tāṉ"}]},{"text":"பிறந்த","tr":"piṟanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிறந்","tr":"piṟan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"வூர்க்கே","tr":"vūrkkē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வூர்க்","tr":"vūrk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கே","tr":"kē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நுதி","parts":[{"text":"நுதி","lemma":"நுதி","gloss":"sharp tip"}],"gloss":"sharp tip"},{"surface":"வேல்","parts":[{"text":"வேல்","lemma":"வேல்","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"spear"},{"surface":"கொண்டு","parts":[{"text":"கொண்டு","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"having / using"}],"gloss":"having / using"},{"surface":"நுதல்","parts":[{"text":"நுதல்","lemma":"நுதல்","gloss":"forehead"}],"gloss":"forehead"},{"surface":"வியர்","parts":[{"text":"வியர்","lemma":"வியர்","gloss":"sweat"}],"gloss":"sweat"},{"surface":"தொடையா","parts":[{"text":"தொடையா","lemma":"துடை","gloss":"wiping"}],"gloss":"wiping"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடிய","parts":[{"text":"கடிய","lemma":"கடிது","gloss":"harsh words"}],"gloss":"harsh words"},{"surface":"கூறும்","parts":[{"text":"கூறும்","lemma":"கூறு","gloss":"speaking"}],"gloss":"speaking"},{"surface":"வேந்தே","parts":[{"text":"வேந்து","lemma":"வேந்து","gloss":"king"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"vocative / emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"O king!"},{"surface":"தந்தையும்","parts":[{"text":"தந்தை","lemma":"தந்தை","gloss":"father"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the father"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடிய","parts":[{"text":"நெடிய","lemma":"நெடிது","gloss":"haughty / long words"}],"gloss":"haughty words"},{"surface":"அல்லது","parts":[{"text":"அல்லது","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"other than"}],"gloss":"other than"},{"surface":"பணிந்து","parts":[{"text":"பணிந்து","lemma":"பணி","gloss":"bowing / submitting"}],"gloss":"submissively"},{"surface":"மொழியலனே","parts":[{"text":"மொழி","lemma":"மொழி","gloss":"speak"},{"text":"அலன்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"he is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he will not speak"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இஃது","parts":[{"text":"இஃது","lemma":"இஃது","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"இவர்","parts":[{"text":"இவர்","lemma":"இவர்","gloss":"their"}],"gloss":"their"},{"surface":"படிவம்","parts":[{"text":"படிவம்","lemma":"படிவம்","gloss":"nature / state"}],"gloss":"nature"},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"ஆயின்","gloss":"if it is"}],"gloss":"if it is"},{"surface":"வை","parts":[{"text":"வை","lemma":"வை","gloss":"sharp"}],"gloss":"sharp"},{"surface":"எயிற்று","parts":[{"text":"எயிற்று","lemma":"எயிறு","gloss":"of the teeth"}],"gloss":"of the teeth"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரி","parts":[{"text":"அரி","lemma":"அரி","gloss":"red streaks"}],"gloss":"red-streaked"},{"surface":"மதர்","parts":[{"text":"மதர்","lemma":"மதர்","gloss":"lustrous / roving"}],"gloss":"lustrous"},{"surface":"மழை","parts":[{"text":"மழை","lemma":"மழை","gloss":"cool / rain-like"}],"gloss":"cool"},{"surface":"கண்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eyes"}],"gloss":"eyes"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அழகு","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"மா","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"dark / mango-leaf colored"}],"gloss":"dark-complexioned"},{"surface":"அரிவை","parts":[{"text":"அரிவை","lemma":"அரிவை","gloss":"young woman"}],"gloss":"young woman"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மரம்","parts":[{"text":"மரம்","lemma":"மரம்","gloss":"wood / tree"}],"gloss":"tree"},{"surface":"படு","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"born / arising"}],"gloss":"born"},{"surface":"சிறு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறுமை","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small"},{"surface":"தீ","parts":[{"text":"தீ","lemma":"தீ","gloss":"fire"}],"gloss":"fire"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அணங்கு","parts":[{"text":"அணங்கு","lemma":"அணங்கு","gloss":"torment / destructive deity"}],"gloss":"torment"},{"surface":"ஆயினள்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினள்","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"she became"}],"gloss":"she became"},{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"herself"}],"gloss":"herself"},{"surface":"பிறந்த","parts":[{"text":"பிறந்த","lemma":"பிற","gloss":"born"}],"gloss":"born"},{"surface":"ஊர்க்கே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்க்கு","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"to the town"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed / emphasis"}],"gloss":"to the town itself"}]}],"literal":"With a sharp spear, wiping the sweat of his forehead, / the king speaks harsh demands. And the father, / other than haughty words, will not speak submissively. / If this is their nature, she of sharp teeth, / red-streaked, lustrous, cool eyes, the beautiful dark young woman, / like a small fire born in a tree, / has become a torment to the very town where she was born.","translation":"Wiping the sweat from his forehead with the tip of his sharp spear, the king speaks harsh demands. The girl's father, too, speaks only haughty words and will never speak submissively. Since this is the nature of both sides, this beautiful, dark young woman with sharp teeth and red-streaked, lustrous, cool eyes has become like a small spark of fire born within a tree, bringing destruction to the very town where she was born.","modern":"கூர்மையான வேலின் நுனியால் தன் நெற்றி வியர்வையைத் துடைத்துக் கொண்டு அரசன் சினந்து பேசுகிறான். பெண்ணின் தந்தையோ, பணிந்து பேசாமல் வீராப்பாகவே பேசுகிறான். இரு தரப்பினரின் நிலையும் இவ்வாறு இருக்க, கூர்மையான பற்களையும், செவ்வரி ஓடிய குளிர்ந்த கண்களையும் உடைய இந்த அழகிய இளம்பெண், மரத்தில் தோன்றும் சிறு நெருப்பு அந்த மரத்தையே அழிப்பது போல, தான் பிறந்த ஊருக்கே அழிவைத் தரும் அணங்காக மாறிவிட்டாள்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by a concerned bystander or town elder witnessing a tense standoff. A powerful king has arrived with his army to demand the hand of a local chieftain's daughter, wiping his sweating brow with his spear tip as he makes harsh demands. The girl's father, proud and unyielding, refuses to submit and speaks only defiant words. The speaker laments that because of the stubborn pride of both men, the beautiful young woman has become a source of doom for her own community. She is compared to a tiny spark of fire born inside a tree, which eventually burns down the entire tree that nurtured it. This poem belongs to the Kāñci tiṇai and the Makaṭpāṟ Kāñci tuṟai, which depicts the tragic consequences when a father refuses to give his daughter in marriage to a king.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.35],[1.35,1.4],[1.4,2.5],[2.5,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,4.7],[4.7,5.1],[5.1,5.73],[6.0,6.1],[6.4,7.0],[7.0,7.4],[7.4,7.6],[7.6,8.4],[8.4,9.5],[9.5,9.5],[9.5,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,11.44],[11.44,11.44],[11.44,11.9],[11.9,12.48],[12.48,13.2],[13.2,13.4],[13.4,13.8],[13.8,14.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.55],[1.55,1.6],[1.6,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,5.1],[5.1,5.6],[5.6,8.5],[8.5,9.1],[9.1,9.1],[9.1,9.1],[9.1,9.1],[9.1,9.7],[9.7,9.7],[9.7,9.7],[9.7,9.7],[9.7,11.5],[11.5,12.5],[12.5,13.07],[13.07,13.4],[13.4,14.05],[14.05,14.7],[14.7,14.9],[14.9,15.3],[15.3,15.5]]}}